but if you understood how important meaning is , then you would figure out that it &apos;s actually important to spend some time , energy and effort in getting people to care more about what they &apos;re doing .
the next experiment was slightly different .
that was the task .
and people did the first she@@ et .
and then we asked them if they wanted to do the next she@@ et for a little bit less money and the next she@@ et for a little bit less money , and so on and so forth .
and we had three conditions .
