and in the third condition , the experim@@ enter got the she@@ et of paper and directly put it into a sh@@ red@@ der .
what happened in those three conditions ?
in this p@@ lot i &apos;m showing you at what pay rate people stopped .
so low numbers mean that people worked harder . they worked for much longer .
