on the other hand , because it &apos;s a rec@@ tan@@ gle , the area is equal to its hei@@ ght times its base , and the hei@@ ght is clearly eight , and the base is five plus eight , which is the next fi@@ bon@@ acc@@ i number , 13 . right ?
