and by ans@@ wer@@ ing that question , i think we can take something extremely powerful away .
and i think the most interesting way to think about how all this is going on is in terms of re@@ wards .
and specifically , it &apos;s in terms of the very inten@@ se emotional re@@ wards that playing games off@@ ers to people both individu@@ ally and colle@@ c@@ tively .
now if we look at what &apos;s going on in someone &apos;s head when they are being enga@@ ged , two quite different processes are oc@@ curr@@ ing .
