it &apos;s a really great image . it &apos;s pretty cool .
and this kind of a world , this vast flying be@@ ast you can ride around , shows why games are so very good at doing both the wan@@ ting and the li@@ king .
because it &apos;s very powerful . it &apos;s pretty a@@ wes@@ ome .
