the com@@ pre@@ hen@@ sive peace agre@@ ement for sud@@ an sig@@ ned in 2005 turned out to be less com@@ pre@@ hen@@ sive than en@@ vis@@ a@@ ged , and its pro@@ visi@@ ons may yet bear the see@@ ds of a ful@@ l-@@ scale return to war between north and south .
