ar@@ v@@ ind gu@@ p@@ ta : turning tr@@ ash into to@@ ys for learning
at the ink conference , ar@@ v@@ ind gu@@ p@@ ta shares simple yet stun@@ ning plans for turning tr@@ ash into seriously entertain@@ ing , well-@@ designed to@@ ys that kids can build themselves -- while learning basic principles of science and design .
i &apos;d like to start with a couple of quick examples .
