nature works very differently .
in eco@@ systems , the waste from one organis@@ m becomes the nutri@@ ent for something else in that system .
and there are some examples of projects that have deli@@ ber@@ ately tried to mi@@ mic eco@@ systems .
and one of my favor@@ ites is called the car@@ d@@ board to ca@@ vi@@ ar project by gra@@ ham wi@@ les .
