what we are trying to say is that once you ou@@ ts@@ our@@ ce the bottom end of the la@@ d@@ der , you -- it &apos;s a self-@@ per@@ pe@@ tu@@ ating act , because of the sin@@ king sk@@ ill la@@ d@@ der , and the sin@@ king sk@@ ill la@@ d@@ der is simply the point that you can &apos;t be an investment ban@@ ker without having been an analy@@ st once .
