so , if you ou@@ ts@@ our@@ ce the least sophisti@@ cated jobs , at some stage , the next step of the la@@ d@@ der has to follow .
if the r &amp; amp ; d talent is going to be based out of india and china , and the largest growth markets are going to be based out of india and china , you have to con@@ front the problem that your top management of the future is going to have to come out of india and china , because that &apos;s where the product leadership is , that &apos;s where the important market leadership is .
