i just think that this example points us to a general reali@@ zation , and that is no matter what technology or design you look at , even something we consider as well inten@@ ded and as good in its effects -- like stu@@ tz@@ man &apos;s freedom -- comes with certain values em@@ bed@@ ded in it .
and we can question these values .
