how can the nervous system get this so wrong ?
how can the nervous system mis@@ interpre@@ t an inno@@ cent sen@@ sation like the touch of a hand and turn it into the mal@@ evol@@ ent sen@@ sation of the touch of the fl@@ ame ?
well you probably imagine that the nervous system in the body is hard@@ wired like your house .
in your house , wir@@ es run in the wall , from the light switch to a jun@@ ction box in the cei@@ ling and from the jun@@ ction box to the light bul@@ b .
