now you might look at this result and say , okay , sure , on average people are less happy when they &apos;re min@@ d-@@ wander@@ ing , but sur@@ ely when their minds are stra@@ ying away from something that wasn &apos;t very enjo@@ y@@ able to begin with , at least then min@@ d-@@ wander@@ ing should be doing something good for us .
