well , one fact that we can take advantage of , i think a fact you &apos;ll all agree is true , is that time goes forward , not back@@ ward . right ? the cause has to come before the effect .
we &apos;re lucky in this data we have many respon@@ ses from each person , and so we can look and see , does min@@ d-@@ wander@@ ing tend to pre@@ ce@@ de un@@ happiness , or does un@@ happiness tend to pre@@ ce@@ de min@@ d-@@ wander@@ ing , to get some insi@@ ght into the cau@@ sal direction .
