the fa@@ a , about a year ago , gave us an ex@@ emp@@ tion for the transition to allow us to have an addi@@ tional 1@@ 10 l@@ bs .
within the light sport air@@ craft categ@@ ory .
now that doesn &apos;t sound like a lot , but it &apos;s very important , because being able to deliver the transition as a light sport air@@ craft makes it simpl@@ er for us to cer@@ ti@@ fy it , but it also makes it much easier for you to learn how to fly it .
