in this deeply personal talk , nigeri@@ an writer chris ab@@ an@@ i says that &quot; what we know about how to be who we are &quot; comes from stories . he sear@@ ches for the heart of africa through its po@@ em@@ s and narra@@ tive , including his own .
and when i meet the mothers in so many of these remote places , i &apos;m really stru@@ ck by the things that we have in common .
