i feel that , if we can understand what makes something like co@@ ca@@ -@@ col@@ a u@@ bi@@ qu@@ it@@ ous , we can apply those lessons then for the public good .
co@@ ke &apos;s success is relevant , because if we can analy@@ ze it , learn from it , then we can save lives .
so that &apos;s why i took a bit of time to study co@@ ke .
and i think there are really three things we can take away from co@@ ca@@ -@@ col@@ a .
they take re@@ al-@@ time data and immediately feed it back into the product .
so let &apos;s start with the data .
now co@@ ke has a very clear bottom line -- they report to a set of sh@@ are@@ hol@@ ders , they have to turn a profit .
