re@@ al-@@ time data turns on the lights .
so what &apos;s the second thing that co@@ ke &apos;s good at ?
they &apos;re good at ta@@ pping into that local entrepr@@ en@@ eu@@ ri@@ al talent .
co@@ ke &apos;s been in africa since 19@@ 28 , but most of the time they couldn &apos;t reach the dist@@ ant markets , because they had a system that was a lot like in the developed world , which was a large tru@@ ck roll@@ ing down the street .
