there are now some 3,000 of these centers emplo@@ ying about 15@@ ,000 people in africa .
in tanz@@ ania and uganda , they represent 90 percent of co@@ ke &apos;s sal@@ es .
let &apos;s look at the development side .
what is it that governments and n@@ gos can learn from co@@ ke ?
governments and n@@ gos need to ta@@ p into that local entrepr@@ en@@ eu@@ ri@@ al talent as well , because the lo@@ cals know how to reach the very har@@ d-@@ to-@@ serve places , their neighb@@ ors , and they know what motiv@@ ates them to make change .
