so if you &apos;re in an emergen@@ cy situation -- or if you &apos;re a mom about to deliver a baby -- forget it , to get to the health care center .
they decided that wasn &apos;t good enough , so they went to india and studied the indian state of ker@@ ala that also had a system like this , and they adap@@ ted it for ethi@@ op@@ ia .
and in 2003 , the government of ethi@@ op@@ ia started this new system in their own country .
