that is having real impact in a country like ethi@@ op@@ ia , and it &apos;s why you see their child mortality numbers coming down 25 percent from 2000 to 2008 .
so what &apos;s the next step for ethi@@ op@@ ia ?
well , they &apos;re already starting talk about this .
