one of these , and it &apos;s parado@@ x@@ ical because it &apos;s lin@@ ked to something that &apos;s rather nice , is the hope we all have for our care@@ ers .
never before have expec@@ tations been so high about what human beings can achieve with their li@@ fes@@ pan .
we &apos;re told , from many sources , that anyone can achieve anything .
