one of the fascinating things about the blo@@ go@@ sphere specifically , and , of course , the internet more generally -- and it &apos;s going to seem like a very obvious point , but i think it is an important one to think about -- is that the people who are gener@@ ating these enormous re@@ ams of content every day , who are spending enormous amo@@ unts of time organi@@ zing , lin@@ king , comm@@ enting on the sub@@ stance of the internet , are doing so pri@@ mar@@ ily for free .
