you know , as chris mentioned , i wrote a book called &quot; the wisdom of crow@@ ds . &quot;
and the pre@@ mis@@ e of &quot; the wisdom of crow@@ ds &quot; is that , under the right conditions , groups can be remark@@ ably intelligent .
