t@@ ying yourself to a ma@@ st is perhaps the ol@@ dest written example of what psych@@ ologists call a commit@@ ment device .
a commit@@ ment device is a decision that you make with a cool head to b@@ ind yourself so that you don &apos;t do something re@@ gre@@ tt@@ able when you have a hot head .
because there &apos;s two heads inside one person when you think about it .
