sometimes a good person would find it , sometimes a bad person would find it .
such it is with commit@@ ment devices .
but despite my like for them , there &apos;s two na@@ g@@ ging concern@@ s that i &apos;ve always had about commit@@ ment devices , and you might feel this if you use them yourself .
so the first is , when you &apos;ve got one of these devices going , such as this contra@@ ct to write everyday or pay , it &apos;s just a const@@ ant remin@@ der that you have no self-@@ control .
