and then when you &apos;re ever in a situation where you don &apos;t have a commit@@ ment device in place -- like , &quot; oh my god , that person &apos;s off@@ ering me a dou@@ gh@@ nu@@ t , and i have no defen@@ se mechan@@ ism , &quot; -- you just eat it .
