at the same time , the reti@@ re@@ ment risk inde@@ x , the chance of not being able to meet your needs in reti@@ re@@ ment , has been increasing .
and we &apos;re at a situation now where for every three baby bo@@ om@@ ers , the m@@ ck@@ inse@@ y global institute predi@@ cts that two will not be able to meet their pre-@@ reti@@ re@@ ment needs while they &apos;re in reti@@ re@@ ment .
so what can we do about this ?
there &apos;s a philosop@@ her , derek par@@ fit , who said some words that were in@@ spir@@ ing to my co@@ auth@@ ors and i .
he said that , &quot; we might ne@@ g@@ le@@ ct our future selves because of some failure of belief or imagination . &quot;
