by using this tool over and over and simul@@ ating out@@ come after out@@ come , people can understand that the invest@@ ments and sav@@ ings that they under@@ take today deter@@ mine their well-@@ being in the future .
now people are motiv@@ ated through emotions , but different people find different things motiv@@ ating .
