so here i made a distribution buil@@ der where instead of showing nu@@ mer@@ ical out@@ comes , i show people what those out@@ comes will get you , in particular a@@ part@@ ments that you can afford if you &apos;re reti@@ ring on 3,000 , 2,@@ 500 , 2,000 dollars per month and so on .
