the last thing i &apos;ll show you , the last behavi@@ oral time machine , is something that i created with ha@@ l her@@ sh@@ field , who was introduced to me by my co@@ auth@@ or on a previous project , bill shar@@ pe .
and what it is is an exploration into virtual reality .
so what we do is we take pictures of people -- in this case , colle@@ ge-@@ age people -- and we use software to age them and show these people what they &apos;ll look like when they &apos;re 60 , 70 , 80 years old .
