at the species level , it &apos;s been esti@@ ma@@ ted that inse@@ c@@ t-@@ based pol@@ lin@@ ation , bees pol@@ lin@@ ating fru@@ it and so on , is something like 19@@ 0 billion doll@@ ar@@ s-@@ worth .
that &apos;s something like eight percent of the total agri@@ cultural out@@ put glob@@ ally .
it completely pas@@ ses below the ra@@ dar screen .
or for that matter , if you look at the genetic level , 60 percent of medi@@ cin@@ es were pro@@ spe@@ cted , were found first as molecules in a rain@@ forest or a re@@ e@@ f .
once again , most of that doesn &apos;t get paid .
