we did esti@@ mates in our study that for countries like brazil , india and in@@ don@@ es@@ ia , even though ecosystem services -- these benefits that flow from nature to humanity for free -- they &apos;re not very big in percentage terms of g@@ dp -- two , four , eight , 10 , 15 percent -- but in these countries , if we measure how much they &apos;re worth to the poor , the answers are more like 45 percent , 75 percent , 90 percent .
