so these fun@@ er@@ als are characteri@@ zed by el@@ abor@@ ate ritu@@ als that tie people in a system of reci@@ pro@@ cal de@@ bt based on the amount of animals -- pig@@ s , chi@@ ck@@ ens and , most importantly , water bu@@ ff@@ al@@ o -- that are sac@@ ri@@ fi@@ ced and distribu@@ ted in the name of the de@@ ce@@ ased .
