i think that tor@@ a@@ j@@ ans so@@ cially recognize and cul@@ tur@@ ally express what many of us feel to be true despite the wi@@ des@@ pre@@ ad accep@@ tan@@ ce of the bi@@ ome@@ di@@ cal definition of death , and that is that our relationships with other humans , their impact on our social reality , doesn &apos;t ce@@ ase with the ter@@ min@@ ation of the physical processes of the body , that there &apos;s a period of transition as the relationship between the living and the dead is trans@@ formed but not ended .
