so , in talking about values we are talking about facts .
now , of course our situation in the world can be understood at many levels -- from the level of the genome on up to the level of economic systems and political arr@@ ange@@ ments .
but if we &apos;re going to talk about human well-@@ being we are , of ne@@ c@@ essi@@ ty , talking about the human brain .
because we know that our experience of the world and of ourselves within it is realized in the brain -- whatever happens after death .
