and so therefore whatever cultural vari@@ ation there is in how human beings fl@@ our@@ ish can , at least in principle , be understood in the context of a ma@@ turing science of the mind -- neuro@@ science , psychology , etc .
so , what i &apos;m argu@@ ing is that value &apos;s re@@ duced to facts -- to facts about the conscious experience of conscious beings .
and we can therefore visu@@ alize a space of possible changes in the experience of these beings .
