so it sounds like i &apos;m painting a really b@@ lea@@ k picture of this place , but i promise there is good news .
the biggest as@@ set , in my opini@@ on , one of the biggest asse@@ ts in ber@@ tie coun@@ ty right now is this man : this is dr. chip zu@@ ll@@ inger , f@@ on@@ dly known as dr. z .
