i want to start my talk today with two obser@@ va@@ tions about the human species .
the first obser@@ vation is something that you might think is quite obvious , and that &apos;s that our species , homo sa@@ pi@@ ens , is actually really , really smart -- like , ridi@@ cul@@ ously smart -- like you &apos;re all doing things that no other species on the planet does right now .
and this is , of course , not the first time you &apos;ve probably recogni@@ zed this .
